# Retail Sales Analytics

## Project Overview

This project analyzes retail sales data to identify sales,
profitability, product, customer, and regional performance.

## Tools

- Power BI
- Power Query
- SQL
- Excel

## Current Progress

- Dataset understanding
- Data profiling
- Data cleaning
- Dimensional data modeling
- Fact and dimension tables
- Power BI relationships

## Data Model

The project uses a star schema consisting of:

- Fact_Orders
- DimProduct
- DimLocation
- Calendar

## Project Status

In Progress
